<title>USA: U.S. June factory orders rose 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. June factory orders rose 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce seasonally adjusted data  on U.S. factory orders, shipments and unfilled orders.</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Jun--(Prev)	May--(Prev)     Apr</p>
<p> New Orders		  1.2		 -0.5   -0.7	1.4</p>
<p> -Ex-Transportation	0.3		 -0.4   -0.4	1.2</p>
<p> -Ex-Defense		 1.0		 -0.2   -0.4	1.0</p>
<p> NonDurables		-0.3		 -0.6   -0.7	0.8</p>
<p> Durables		    2.4    2.3	-0.4   -0.4	1.8</p>
<p> NonDefense Cap	    5.4    5.4	 1.1    1.1     -1.7</p>
<p> -Ex-Aircraft, Parts     1.7    1.7	-0.6   -0.5     -1.5</p>
<p> -Defense Cap	     13.4    9.9     -11.9  -12.0     27.5</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Jun--(Prev)	May--(Prev)     Apr</p>
<p> Durables NonDefense     2.1    2.1	Unch    0.1	1.1</p>
