<p>  Total			0.9		 -1.0   -1.0	1.2</p>
<p>  Durables		   2.0    1.8	-1.4   -1.5	1.3</p>
<p> ORDERS-BLNS OF DLRS:   Jun---(Prev)     May---(Prev)     Apr</p>
<p>  New Orders	    327.86	     324.04  323.32   325.54</p>
<p>  -Ex-Transportation  285.34	     284.62  284.80   285.83</p>
