<p>  Durables		180.71  180.58   176.44  176.48   177.11</p>
<p>  NonDef. Cap	    46.62   46.64    44.21   44.24    43.75</p>
<p>  -Ex-Aircraft,Parts   38.98   39.04    38.33   38.37    38.57</p>
<p>  Defense Cap	     6.26    6.07     5.52    5.52     6.27</p>
<p>  DurablesNonDefense  174.45  174.51   170.92  170.96   170.84</p>
