<p> ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:     Jun--(Prev)	May--(Prev)     Apr</p>
<p>  Primary Metals	   0.3    0.4	-2.4   -2.4	2.4</p>
<p>  Industrial Machinery  -0.9   -0.6	-3.3   -3.1	3.0</p>
<p>  Electrical Equipment   0.2   Unch	10.6   10.7     -3.2</p>
<p>  Transport Equipment    7.9    7.5	-0.7   -0.9	2.8</p>
