<p>  Primary Metals	 15.56   15.59    15.52   15.53    15.90</p>
<p>  Industrial Machin.   32.47   32.61    32.75   32.81    33.86</p>
<p>  Electrical Equip.    30.90   30.87    30.85   30.87    27.88</p>
<p>  Transport Equip.     42.52   42.30    39.42   39.35    39.72</p>
<p>The June inventories-to-shipments ratio was 1.36 months' worth, down  from 1.37 months' worth in May.</p>
<p>Wall Street economists had expected June factory orders to rise 1.5  percent.</p>
<p>The 2.4 percent increase in durable goods orders was the strongest  rise since 3.4 percent in January.  </p>
<p>The department reported initial data on June orders for durable goods  on July 25.</p>
